firewall-web (1.0.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add read-only exact Port Checker as the first menu item, with rule locations and service usage.
  * Remove custom appearance colors; add three readable light profiles.
  * Prevent writes through unsupported managers and conflicting boot restorers.
  * Correct UFW route/port syntax and preserve unrelated manager-owned rules.
  * Start confirmation windows after response verification and retain durable rollback.
  * Allow bounded slow systemd enable and daemon-reload operations.
  * Preserve validated unattended installation, upgrades and removal behavior.

